{
  "id": "ISA.57",
  "number": "57",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 57",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "57",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 57"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "57",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous perisheth, and no man layeth it to heart; and merciful men are taken away, none considering that the righteous is taken away from the evil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He entereth into peace; they rest in their beds, each one that walketh in his uprightness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But draw near hither, ye sons of the sorceress, the seed of the adulterer and the harlot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Against whom do ye sport yourselves? against whom make ye a wide mouth, and put out the tongue? are ye not children of transgression, a seed of falsehood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye that inflame yourselves among the oaks, under every green tree; that slay the children in the valleys, under the clefts of the rocks? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Among the smooth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the valley is thy portion; they, they are thy lot; even to them hast thou poured a drink-offering, thou hast offered an oblation. Shall I be appeased for these things? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upon a high and lofty mountain hast thou set thy bed; thither also wentest thou up to offer sacrifice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behind the doors and the posts hast thou set up thy memorial: for thou hast uncovered ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to another than me, and art gone up; thou hast enlarged thy bed, and made thee a covenant with them: thou lovedst their bed where thou sawest it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou wentest to the king with oil, and didst increase thy perfumes, and didst send thine ambassadors far off, and didst debase thyself even unto Sheol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou wast wearied with the length of thy way; yet saidst thou not, It is in vain: thou didst find a quickening of thy strength; therefore thou wast not faint.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of whom hast thou been afraid and in fear, that thou liest, and hast not remembered me, nor laid it to thy heart? have not I held my peace even of long time, and thou fearest me not? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will declare thy righteousness; and as for thy works, they shall not profit thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou criest, let them that thou hast gathered deliver thee; but the wind shall take them, a breath shall carry them all away: but he that taketh refuge in me shall possess the land, and shall inherit my holy mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he will say, Cast ye up, cast ye up, prepare the way, take up the stumbling-block out of the way of my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the high and lofty One that inhabiteth eternity, whose name is Holy: I dwell in the high and holy place, with him also that is of a contrite and humble spirit, to revive the spirit of the humble, and to revive the heart of the contrite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will not contend for ever, neither will I be always wroth; for the spirit would faint before me, and the souls that I have made. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the iniquity of his covetousness was I wroth, and smote him; I hid ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and was wroth; and he went on backsliding in the way of his heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen his ways, and will heal him: I will lead him also, and restore comforts unto him and to his mourners. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I create the fruit of the lips: Peace, peace, to him that is far off and to him that is near, saith Jehovah; and I will heal him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the wicked are like the troubled sea; for it cannot rest, and its waters cast up mire and dirt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is no peace, saith my God, to the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.58",
    "number": "58",
    "bookId": "ISA"
  },
